{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39068","headline":"晓感 · 褚载","name":"晓感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓鼓冬冬星汉微，佩金鸣玉鬬光辉。\n出门各自争岐路，至老何人免是非。\n大道不应由曲取，浮生还要畧知机。\n故园华表高高在，可得不如丁令威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}